{"resourceIdentifier":"2260","resourceName":"Shandong Laiwu Landfill Gas Recovery and Power Generation Project","description":"Shandong Laiwu Landfill Gas Recovery and Power Generation Project (hereafter, the “Project”) is located in the Laiwu Landfill, in Laiwu City, Shandong Province, P.R. China.\r\nThe Project activity involves the installation of a gas extraction system, a pre-treatment system, a landfill gas power generation plant and flaring equipment. When the landfill gas being extracted exceeds the amount of gas demanded by the generator, excess gas will be flared. The implementation of the Project activity will reduce the emission of methane into the air, leading to a reduction in greenhouse gas emissions.\r\nIn addition, average annual electricity generation of the project over the project lifetime will be approximately 8,106MWh and net electricity delivered to the North China Power Grid will be 7,457MWh , displacing electricity generation from fossil fuels and reducing GHG emissions. The annual emission reductions are estimated to be 40,629 tCO2e in the fixed 10-year crediting period.","location":{"latitude":36.283900,"longitude":117.727800},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2020-04-14","endExclusive":"2020-05-15","endInclusive":"2020-05-14"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2260"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shandong"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shandong Micropowers New Energy Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Late to verify"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2260"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"35497"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":